{"version":1,"content":"<p>【18：34更新】西貢沙角尾村昨晚(22日)發生停電事故。</p><p>昨晚7時許，上址有地底電纜疑老化損壞冒煙，約50村屋一度停電，約90戶受影響。</p><p>中電接報後隨即派員到場搶修，並安排臨時電纜為居民供電，於午夜前完成搶修回復供電。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:53.206177+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:41:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:18:05.817267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.854756+00:00","content_hash":"96bea503ec6161b9db3882d4d95e4f3ecf6177385e8aec0519da06624b3edbfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}